      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <description>
From the city of Fedfer near the Atlantic ocean, good morning, good evening, wherever you may be, across the nation, around the world. This is Epicenter of Light FM, 107.3, radio for your light and your waves.
I&rsquo;m Jeffrey John, that&rsquo;s Jay Oh Hen. And that’s a Hen with a capital &ldquo;H&rdquo;, my friends, and this is Chatty Chakras, a place for us to gather together, to join forces, and share loving insights, spiritual experiences, suggest paths to the divine, let&rsquo;s now chat and open our chakras. We&rsquo;re grateful to our sponsor, Malone Kitchens: uniquely yours, uniquely cut, uniquely you. Malone brings over 35 years of design experience and creativity to the greater Fedfer area. Our certified master kitchen and bath designers constantly seek influence from classical, transitional, eclectic and Asian palettes. Open every day, on the corner of Tanzelli and 89th. Malone Kitchens: uniquely yours, uniquely cut, uniquely you.
